{"h":3396,"w":2400,"lines":[{"x":0.077831243215298732,"w":0.25791776021321616,"h":0.034988807705181646,"t":"Audioscripts","c":1,"y":0.082796293802864573},{"y":0.1468023254294053,"c":1,"w":0.098765430450439451,"h":0.014563987898180697,"t":"TEST 1","x":0.40123456858620615},{"w":0.10295319239298502,"y":0.20771964789183761,"t":"PART 1","x":0.078153033332523894,"c":1,"h":0.014793262324428569},{"w":0.051523545583089178,"y":0.23824796109360447,"h":0.0089691940550248317,"c":1,"t":"SARAH:","x":0.08020530528574811},{"h":0.01207063223363658,"c":1,"w":0.057789090474446622,"t":"FATHER:","x":0.078101340293841706,"y":0.25268561392775957},{"h":0.010578213928725821,"x":0.080168352905534868,"w":0.051597448984781913,"c":1,"t":"SARAH:","y":0.26869345101180997},{"t":"FATHER:","c":1,"y":0.28335924419939074,"x":0.07815826665115537,"h":0.013223371741628465,"w":0.059732850392659506},{"w":0.051440327962239588,"h":0.010174418787512574,"t":"SARAH:","c":1,"y":0.31540697663155859,"x":0.080246914109586662},{"y":0.33139534872761001,"c":1,"w":0.059670778910318995,"t":"FATHER:","x":0.078189301796310229,"h":0.010174418787512574},{"h":0.0089053383143125053,"x":0.080215899026949172,"t":"SARAH.","y":0.34729151687228277,"w":0.051502358118693053,"c":1},{"w":0.057653115590413417,"t":"FATHER:","x":0.08022694004803585,"c":1,"y":0.39238513077435444,"h":0.010287877948882196},{"c":1,"t":"SARAH:","y":0.40843023246232857,"x":0.080246914105299966,"w":0.051440327962239574,"h":0.008720930389296444},{"h":0.010174418787512574,"t":"FATHER:","y":0.4389534882624937,"w":0.057613169352213556,"c":1,"x":0.078189299994675138},{"t":"SARAH:","y":0.45392737813466844,"w":0.053933582305908195,"x":0.080012128428655988,"h":0.010222443983889051,"c":1},{"h":0.008720930389296444,"x":0.080246912731694972,"c":1,"t":"SARAH:","y":0.51598837199648551,"w":0.053497943878173818},{"w":0.059670778910319022,"x":0.078189301799984512,"y":0.55232558128507658,"h":0.010174418787512574,"c":1,"t":"FATHER:"},{"t":"SARAH:","h":0.008898366045193562,"x":0.080217061245565477,"c":1,"w":0.051500034332275416,"y":0.58276011922954163},{"t":"FATHER:","x":0.078120575886578836,"w":0.061865844726562508,"h":0.013408793437045707,"y":0.59722002177548095,"c":1},{"t":"SARAH.","y":0.61470954502752473,"w":0.053572800954182945,"c":1,"h":0.008953002934180665,"x":0.080209484197655792},{"t":"FATHER:","y":0.67441860439015855,"w":0.057613169352213556,"c":1,"h":0.010174418787512574,"x":0.082304527120875381},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"SARAH:","w":0.055555553436279284,"x":0.078189301632830374,"c":1,"y":0.6904069765566373},{"t":"FATHER:","y":0.72043468844096537,"c":1,"w":0.060042476654052726,"x":0.080061066586677346,"h":0.012618994965570063},{"x":0.08230452726973754,"t":"SARAH:","h":0.010174418787512574,"y":0.73691860453853542,"w":0.051440327962239588,"c":1},{"h":0.0093419807398136268,"x":0.082213539444858749,"c":1,"y":0.76713133519480636,"w":0.057795143127441398,"t":"FATHER:"},{"t":"SARAH:","w":0.053664824167887371,"h":0.010621405602624812,"c":1,"y":0.78320673903790994,"x":0.082221085751796041},{"y":0.82968829684337708,"t":"FATHER:","w":0.057788435618082681,"h":0.010681545495706102,"x":0.082216894053473197,"c":1},{"t":"SARAH:","w":0.053497943878173831,"c":1,"y":0.86191860455602254,"x":0.082304525900419256,"h":0.008720930389296444},{"w":0.33539095560709636,"t":"Hello. Children's Engineering Workshops.","h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"x":0.17489711473576691,"y":0.23546511613547694},{"w":0.6440328979492187,"x":0.17489713116417449,"y":0.25145348823900582,"t":"Oh hello. I wanted some information about the workshops in the school holidays.","c":1,"h":0.014534883982160851},{"t":"Sure.","c":1,"x":0.17635873591886195,"y":0.26694062464846957,"w":0.046714913050333651,"h":0.012469993744076202},{"x":0.17489710714486742,"y":0.2819767440612253,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"I have two daughters who are interested. The younger one's Lydia, she's","w":0.58024693806966154,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"four - do you take children as young as that?","x":0.17283950136104059,"y":0.2979651161443253,"h":0.01453488398216074,"w":0.36419754028320311},{"t":"Yes, our Tiny Engineers workshop is for four to five-year-olds.","h":0.015457383595029683,"y":0.31196184788928893,"w":0.49187962849934902,"c":1,"x":0.17689910112504242},{"t":"What sorts of activities do they do?","x":0.17489711861305271,"y":0.32848837195698455,"c":1,"h":0.014562276002234698,"w":0.28189300537109385},{"y":0.34447674405281703,"c":1,"w":0.617283935546875,"t":"All sorts. For example, they work together to design a special cover that goes","h":0.01453488398216074,"x":0.17489712676648614},{"x":0.17695473530731809,"h":0.013250883392226132,"y":0.35895170805786292,"c":1,"t":"round an egg, so that when it's inside they can drop it from a height and it doesn't","w":0.64814814249674479},{"h":0.011631330977620702,"x":0.17695474152554888,"c":1,"w":0.4958847554524739,"y":0.37499999989276533,"t":"break. Well, sometimes it does break but that's part of the fun!"},{"y":0.3890189633017036,"t":"Right. And Lydia loves building things. Is there any opportunity for her to do that?","w":0.64418568929036457,"h":0.017246699024285661,"c":1,"x":0.17688349639684872},{"x":0.17689423998559733,"y":0.40388812242635219,"c":1,"w":0.63180836995442702,"h":0.016373037309051264,"t":"Well, they have a competition to see who can make the highest tower. You'd be"},{"w":0.24750640869140625,"t":"amazed how high they can go.","h":0.017069276286238777,"x":0.17670816824372546,"y":0.41878303592481547,"c":1},{"h":0.014534883982160851,"y":0.43604651145454199,"c":1,"t":"Right.","x":0.17695473278922991,"w":0.049382715225219725},{"c":1,"h":0.016039732066986945,"x":0.17695472386909178,"y":0.45053003550868098,"w":0.61316874186197912,"t":"But they're learning all the time as well as having fun. For example, one thing"},{"y":0.4664310953113846,"x":0.17489710673270395,"h":0.01472320376914027,"t":"they do is to design and build a car that's attached to a balloon, and the force of","w":0.63786010742187493,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"the air in that actually powers the car and makes it move along. They go really","y":0.48105473746416305,"w":0.62356897989908855,"x":0.17484768673475989,"h":0.017371833675460913},{"h":0.014416502558300515,"t":"fast too.","c":1,"y":0.49755970204172884,"x":0.17424959949537655,"w":0.071290047963460251},{"w":0.25720163981119792,"x":0.17695473553491733,"t":"OK, well, all this sounds perfect.","c":1,"h":0.016195524146054185,"y":0.51295641949243731},{"h":0.016850245715030021,"x":0.17689091456435221,"y":0.54882720729571499,"w":0.58861195882161454,"c":1,"t":"Now Carly, that's my older daughter, has just had her seventh birthday, so"},{"h":0.014570836043610536,"x":0.17695473247634805,"w":0.33333333333333326,"y":0.56537102454462873,"t":"presumably she'd be in a different group?","c":1},{"t":"Yes, she'd be in the Junior Engineers. That's for children from six to eight.","w":0.58655090332031246,"y":0.57917273338648945,"h":0.016859232607101204,"x":0.17689532701191241,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.015607356463500754,"t":"And do they do the same sorts of activities?","y":0.59541134451591704,"x":0.17682409322788581,"w":0.35209719340006507},{"x":0.17690386940415598,"w":0.60711395263671886,"h":0.016460806236671455,"c":1,"y":0.61040863881789642,"t":"Some are the same, but a bit more advanced. So they work out how to build"},{"h":0.016293515586178975,"w":0.61333140055338542,"c":1,"t":"model vehicles, things like cars and trucks, but also how to construct animals","y":0.62525938706090189,"x":0.17893470781559187},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"w":0.61522633870442711,"t":"using the same sorts of material and technique, and then they learn how they","y":0.64244186034429218,"x":0.17901234498780713},{"w":0.33333333333333337,"h":0.013089955625320671,"x":0.1769547324245542,"y":0.6584216723901255,"c":1,"t":"can program them and make them move."},{"t":"So they learn a bit of coding?","c":1,"x":0.17695473021054189,"y":0.67285041237394583,"w":0.23662551879882812,"h":0.014723203769140158},{"y":0.68606601888981145,"t":"They do. They pick it up really quickly. We're there to help if they need it, but","w":0.61544545491536451,"h":0.0188368268232042,"c":1,"x":0.17685881254353092},{"t":"they learn from one another too.","w":0.25925926208496092,"c":1,"x":0.17695473098471581,"y":0.70494186034187489,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"c":1,"y":0.71937573601208038,"x":0.17901234918675055,"w":0.33744855244954419,"h":0.014723203769140158,"t":"Right. And do they have competitions too?"},{"y":0.73401162777315998,"w":0.63168726603190106,"t":"Yes, with the Junior Engineers, it's to use recycled materials like card and wood","h":0.01453488398216074,"x":0.17901233399561561,"c":1},{"t":"to build a bridge, and the longest one gets a prize.","y":0.74999999985900279,"x":0.17695473008030377,"w":0.40329218546549478,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1},{"y":0.76448926527134331,"h":0.01717528240981181,"c":1,"x":0.17689015752515114,"w":0.40757698059082026,"t":"That sounds fun. I wouldn't mind doing that myself!"},{"t":"Then they have something a bit different, which is to think up an idea for a","y":0.78052325568066627,"w":0.59053497314453129,"c":1,"x":0.17695473554215879,"h":0.014534883982160851},{"y":0.79467472531732508,"h":0.015870701999911363,"t":"five-minute movie and then film it, using special animation software. You'd be","c":1,"w":0.61328598022460934,"x":0.17895983508036911},{"y":0.81242638385692634,"t":"amazed what they come up with.","h":0.013250883392226132,"w":0.26748970031738278,"x":0.17695473824098951,"c":1},{"h":0.016524505839892734,"c":1,"y":0.8261644112530987,"x":0.17276278621718377,"t":"•And of course, that's something they can put on their phone and take home to","w":0.62568074544270835},{"y":0.84160748994788059,"t":"show all their friends.","x":0.17679882088150151,"h":0.01604239707560362,"c":1,"w":0.17528476715087893},{"t":"Exactly. And then they also build a robot in the shape of a human, and they","c":1,"x":0.17901234777022532,"h":0.01472320376914027,"y":0.85895170804577992,"w":0.59670781453450517},{"c":1,"h":0.013084819375836831,"y":0.87354651149777507,"t":"decorate it and program it so that it can move its arms and legs.","w":0.50823043823242187,"x":0.18106996628067093},{"t":"Q1","h":0.013081395583944611,"w":0.02880658467610675,"y":0.35755813936282421,"x":0.85390946476071194,"c":1},{"t":"Q2","w":0.02880658467610675,"y":0.40406976729264543,"h":0.011627907185728703,"x":0.85390946476862595,"c":1},{"x":0.85596707772215763,"y":0.4651162788977079,"t":"Q3","w":0.026748971939086874,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1},{"t":"Q4","y":0.62499999982298526,"w":0.026748971939086874,"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.85596707773228975,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.85596707792943638,"w":0.02880658467610675,"y":0.74854651145584739,"t":"Q5","h":0.013081395583944722},{"y":0.79505813938566872,"c":1,"t":"Q6","x":0.85802469088230826,"w":0.026748971939086985,"h":0.011627907185728703},{"y":0.87209302307879943,"x":0.85802469088230848,"t":"Q7","h":0.013081395583944722,"w":0.026748971939086985,"c":1},{"x":0.082304526852131285,"w":0.024691357612609863,"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.90988372075817303,"c":1,"t":"98"},{"h":0.024919042598513186,"c":1,"y":0.95596319330644619,"x":0.71966207165292517,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","w":0.25406321207682303}]}